BT /F2 13.0 Tf 0.08 0.12 0.20 rg 48.0 750.0 Td (3. The AI Research Pipeline & How Citations Fail) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 0.35 0.40 0.48 rg 48.0 734.0 Td (Modern AI research is a multi-stage agentic pipeline with failure points compounding at every transition.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 48.0 716.0 Td (Modern LLM research engines do not perform a single act of cognitive recall. They run an agentic pipeline: User Query ->) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 48.0 704.8 Td (Search Queries -> Source Selection -> Extraction -> Synthesis -> Citations -> Final Answer. Failures compound along each) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 48.0 693.6 Td (seam: search APIs prioritize SEO listicles over primary papers; extraction drops numeric footnotes and caveats; synthesis) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 48.0 682.4 Td (blends conflicting papers into a single false narrative; and citations are routinely hallucinated or mapped onto) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 48.0 671.2 Td (assertions they do not support.) Tj ET
