BT /F2 7.8 Tf 0.15 0.20 0.30 rg 48.0 554.0 Td (- Formulaic Lexicon:) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.5 Tf 0.30 0.30 0.30 rg 56.0 544.0 Td (  Overuse of marker vocabulary: delve, tapestry, testament, beacon, landscape, interplay, foster, underscore, pivotal.) Tj ET
