BT /F2 7.8 Tf 0.12 0.31 0.58 rg 58.0 450.8 Td (THE PROFESSIONAL MOVE & FIVE CORE TAKEAWAYS:) Tj ET
BT /F4 7.2 Tf 0.20 0.25 0.35 rg 58.0 439.8 Td (Never accuse or play gotcha detective. Treat all incoming AI text as unverified drafts and audit the load-bearing claims.) Tj ET
BT /F1 6.8 Tf 0.30 0.35 0.40 rg 58.0 429.8 Td (1. AI research answers are multi-stage agentic pipelines, not acts of recall.) Tj ET
BT /F1 6.8 Tf 0.30 0.35 0.40 rg 58.0 421.3 Td (2. Failures compound at every step: query formulation, search, extraction, synthesis, and citation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 6.8 Tf 0.30 0.35 0.40 rg 58.0 412.8 Td (3. Verify atomic claims, never broad paragraphs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 6.8 Tf 0.30 0.35 0.40 rg 58.0 404.3 Td (4. A citation is merely a lead to inspect, never proof that the statement is true.) Tj ET
BT /F1 6.8 Tf 0.30 0.35 0.40 rg 58.0 395.8 Td (5. The senior-editor check is mandatory: never ship unverified claims to clients or stakeholders.) Tj ET
